Package: ACV2G
Title: Activity–Contact Variant-to-Gene Prioritization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("ACV2G", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "acv2g.dev@localhost")
  )
Description: Prioritizes variant-gene pairs by combining local regulatory
    activity with three-dimensional chromatin contact. The default method
    standardizes pair-level activity-contact proxy values within fixed,
    user-supplied loci. An independent optional method standardizes each
    gene's proxy values over an explicitly declared reference variant
    universe. The package retains missing evidence and quality-control
    provenance and exposes the same computation through an R API and a
    command-line interface.
